  "description": "EKOBAH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C32 H69 La4 N12 O22 1+,N1 O3 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 5 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.786-4.124 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.15-115.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C32H67La4N13O25·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
